y itself from system to system.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-79e7-8613-817166505cd3","description":"Worm","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7f78-b4d5-cb16b9ed9d38","description":"Trojan horse","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-76e9-9361-ebda42feb185","description":"Keylogger","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7dfe-b4cf-26b55a8639d5","description":"Adware","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-717b-94f4-5f981157a44e","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"Which type of spying software or hardware records what a user types?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Keyloggers can capture sensitive information as it is typed.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7c9b-8a59-87983db63455","description":"Keylogger","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7362-94af-4a07d5aa9e12","description":"Port scanner","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7f19-8a51-3a878da80a68","description":"Pop-up blocker","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-747d-98c8-06f8904ffd67","description":"Disk cleaner","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7bd8-a4e1-0ae63806daaa","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"What is a network of compromised devices controlled by an attacker called?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Botnets can be used for spam, attacks, and other malicious activity.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-75ad-a20e-2afdf3c50a38","description":"Botnet","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7338-b6ec-476c5cd10b16","description":"Intranet","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7d2a-841d-448145ae3e03","description":"Honeynet","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7d66-979c-d97b6142b902","description":"Extranet","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21ea9-f880-7497-ad78-8252df935c48","category":"01a21e5d-ee8b-768b-8713-3f779a056aaa","question":"Which attack overwhelms a target with traffic from many sources to make it unavailable?","difficulty":2,"explanation"